多い点数でした。", "その年、ジョーダンはブルズで最後のシーズンを終えました。4勝2敗で6回目の優勝をしました。そして、6回ともファイナルのMVPになりました。"], "paragraphs_zh": ["这件球衣是乔丹在1998年NBA总决赛第二场穿的。上面还有乔丹的签名。那场比赛他得了37分，是全队最高的得分。", "那一年，乔丹在公牛队打完了最后一个赛季。以4胜2负赢得了第六次总冠军。而且六次都当选了总决赛MVP。"], "body": "このユニフォームは、1998年のNBAファイナルの第2戦でジョーダンが着ました。ジョーダンのサインもあります。あの試合で、彼は37点を取りました。チームで一番多い点数でした。\n\nその年、ジョーダンはブルズで最後のシーズンを終えました。4勝2敗で6回目の優勝をしました。そして、6回ともファイナルのMVPになりました。", "body_zh": "这件球衣是乔丹在1998年NBA总决赛第二场穿的。上面还有乔丹的签名。那场比赛他得了37分，是全队最高的得分。\n\n那一年，乔丹在公牛队打完了最后一个赛季。以4胜2负赢得了第六次总冠军。而且六次都当选了总决赛MVP。", "text": "このユニフォームは、1998年のNBAファイナルの第2戦でジョーダンが着ました。ジョーダンのサインもあります。あの試合で、彼は37点を取りました。チームで一番多い点数でした。 その年、ジョーダンはブルズで最後のシーズンを終えました。4勝2敗で6回目の優勝をしました。そして、6回ともファイナルのMVPになりました。", "vocab": [{"word": "ユニフォーム", "pos": "noun", "zh": "球衣，制服", "note": "外来语，体育服装常用", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "売れる", "pos": "verb", "zh": "卖出，畅销", "note": "五段动词，売る的可能形", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "着る", "pos": "verb", "zh": "穿", "note": "上身穿衣用，一段动词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "試合", "pos": "noun", "zh": "比赛", "note": "しあい，常与する搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "点", "pos": "noun", "zh": "分，分数", "note": "体育得分单位", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "優勝", "pos": "noun", "zh": "冠军，夺冠", "note": "する动词，指赢得比赛", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "最高", "pos": "noun", "zh": "最高，最好", "note": "此处指最高纪录", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "去年", "pos": "noun", "zh": "去年", "note": "きょねん，时间名词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "不動産", "pos": "noun", "zh": "房地产", "note": "ふどうさん，与投资搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "芸術", "pos": "noun", "zh": "艺术", "note": "げいじゅつ，常与作品连用", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "title_original": "Jordan 'Last Dance' jersey sells for record £10.6m", "summary_original": "A Michael Jordan jersey from his 'Last Dance' season sells for $14m (£10.6m), a record for a piece of basketball memorabilia.", "body_original": "Jordan 'Last Dance' jersey sells for record £10.6m\nBy\nBen Collins\nBBC Sport journalist\nPublished\n5 hours ago\nA Michael Jordan jersey from his 'Last Dance' season has sold for $14m (£10.6m), a record for a piece of basketball memorabilia.\nJordan wore the Chicago Bulls jersey during game two of the 1998 NBA Finals and has autographed it too.\nHe scored a game-high 37 points that evening before ending his last season with the Bulls with a 4-2 series win for his sixth and final NBA Championship. He was named the Finals' Most Valuable Player in all six.\nThe only item of sports memorabilia that has cost more is the jersey worn by baseball legend Babe Ruth when he \"called the shot\" during the 1932 World Series, which was sold for $24.1m (£18.2m) in 2024.\nThe previous high for a basketball item was a card featuring Jordan and Kobe Bryant from 2007-08 which\nsold for $12.9m (£9.8m) last year.\nThe previous record for a piece of game-worn Jordan memorabilia was set just two weeks ago when his jersey from game three of the 1998 Finals, which is not autographed,\nsold via auction for $12.3m (£9.3m).\nThe latest purchase was made by Miami real estate investor Ron Firman in a private sale through Hunt Auctions.\nDavid Hunt, president of Hunt Auctions, said in a statement: \"While Michael Jordan's importance within the sports memorabilia marketplace has long been established, it has now escalated to an elite asset class more typically reserved for iconic works of art.\"\nRelated topics\nBasketball\nMore on this story\nWhy everyone’s talking about The Last Dance\nPublished\n12 May 2020\nMaradona's 'Hand of God' shirt sells for £7.1m\nPublished\n4 May 2022", "fetched_at": "2026-10-13T02:39:12.219452", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "この", "s": 0.225, "e": 0.525, "sm": 225, "em": 525, "cs": 0, "ce": 2, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "ユニフォーム", "s": 0.525, "e": 1.15, "sm": 525, "em": 1149, "cs": 2, "ce": 8, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "は", "s": 1.15, "e": 1.425, "sm": 1150, "em": 1424, "cs": 8, "ce": 9, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "、", "s": 1.425, "e": 1.75, "sm": 1424, "em": 1749, "cs": 9, "ce": 10, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "1998", "s